SIMULATED SYSTEMS
Files name as SQ contain S(q)
Files named as Gr contain G(r)
303 and 290 are temperatures. Structures are suitable for the same name and temperature. Numbers 512 mean number of molecules.

!!!! BENZENE under 303 K, 1 atm !!!
Duration = 2 ns
Barostat = Berendsen
cutoff = 9 Å
Time step = 2 fs
System composition = 512 benzene molecules
Pressure coupling = isotropic
Force field = GAFF (General Amber force field)
Output = 1 frame every 1 ps

